{"page":28901,"revision":1373607912,"ref":"o10","kind":"application","cue":"heading","strength":"strong","name":"Applications","section":"Applications","section_anchor":"Applications","span":[4463,5748],"text":"## Applications\nThe symmetric group on a set of size n is the Galois group of the general polynomial of degree n and plays an important role in Galois theory. In invariant theory, the symmetric group acts on the variables of a multi-variate function, and the functions left invariant are the so-called symmetric functions. In the representation theory of Lie groups, the representation theory of the symmetric group plays a fundamental role through the ideas of Schur functors.\nIn the theory of Coxeter groups, the symmetric group is the Coxeter group of type An and occurs as the Weyl group of the general linear group. In combinatorics, the symmetric groups, their elements (permutations), and their representations provide a rich source of problems involving Young tableaux, plactic monoids, and the Bruhat order. Subgroups of symmetric groups are called permutation groups and are widely studied because of their importance in understanding group actions, homogeneous spaces, and automorphism groups of graphs, such as the Higman–Sims group and the Higman–Sims graph.","links":[{"title":"Galois group"},{"title":"Polynomial"},{"title":"Galois theory"},{"title":"Invariant theory"},{"title":"Symmetric function"},{"title":"Representation theory of Lie groups"},{"title":"Representation theory of the symmetric group"},{"title":"Schur functor"},{"title":"Coxeter group"},{"title":"Weyl group"},{"title":"General linear group"},{"title":"Combinatorics"},{"title":"Permutation"},{"title":"Group representation"},{"title":"Young tableaux"},{"title":"Plactic monoid"},{"title":"Bruhat order"},{"title":"Subgroup"},{"title":"Permutation group"},{"title":"Group action (mathematics)"},{"title":"Homogeneous space"},{"title":"Automorphism group"},{"title":"Graph (discrete mathematics)"},{"title":"Higman–Sims group"},{"title":"Higman–Sims graph"}],"hash":"sha256:f523c4d70d11aeed90ee2af21f1fb706046108a1a363e7a8b990ba6e608f49d7","extractor":"m2/v0.3.8"}
